My golf cart has a few issues.

The major one is the tent structure around it - the driver side does not zi=
p up. It cannot be sealed (the zipper is completely ripped) and with the co=
nstant rain, this means a wet environment while I'm working and potential d=
amage to the unit. I've tried protecting it overnight with a tarp but given=
 the wind, this has not worked as well as I'd hoped. It is still getting ve=
ry wet.

