en smooth. Charles explained this to me but I can't recall the mechanics. H=
e noted he had this unit last month and it was meant to go in for repair. I=
 don't recall seeing any other units up there so I can understand how I end=
ed up with it and I'm fine with the situation, I just want to note it in ca=
se you feel it requires attention.

Thanks
Sam


